@startuml
title Discovery Page (Main Column) Activity Diagram
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor black
skinparam swimlaneTitleBackgroundColor #EEE
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam activityArrowColor #333
skinparam activityBorderColor #333
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 50
scale 1.5
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
|User|
|System| 
|External_API| (Python Recommender Service)

|User|
start
:Access Discovery Page;
|System|
:Get Authenticated User;
:Fetch Recommendations (Service);

|External_API|
if (Interactions >= 10?) then (Yes - Hot Start)
    :Collaborative Filtering (SVD);
    note right
        Algorithm: **Matrix Factorization**
        "Deep Personalization"
    end note
elseif (Interactions >= 5?) then (Yes - Warm Start)
    :Content-Based Filtering;
    note right
        Algorithm: **TF-IDF + Cosine**
        "Find songs like ones you liked"
    end note
else (No - Cold Start)
    :Popularity-Based Filtering;
    note right
        Strategy: **Global Top 50**
        Weighted by Shares (3x) and Likes (1x)
    end note
endif
:Exclude Disliked Songs;
note right
    Removes songs user marked as "Uninterested"
end note
:Apply Social Graph Boosting;
note right
    Increases score if followed friends
    have shared or liked the song.
end note
:Return Song IDs & Scores;

|System|
:Fetch Song Details (Database);
:Sort by Score;
:Render Main Discovery Grid;

|User|
:View Recommended Songs;
:Click Song Shared by Discovery;
|System|
:Redirect to Song Details;
stop
@enduml
